{"unit_id":"kezboardpj__dsh-chat-nav#card-1","repo":"kezboardpj/dsh-chat-nav","commit":"39e34f78abbe336c8c50f6f768763cad3a9fe546","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-nav 是 DSH Web 的对话问题导航插件，在聊天视图左侧显示问题轨道，每条横条对应一条用户提问并自动高亮当前阅读位置。悬停横条可查看提问与助手回答预览，点击即可跳转到对应消息；目标尚未加载时会逐页补拉旧消息，会话打开后也能后台补齐历史。用户还可在通用设置中调整横条长度和条目间距，适合需要浏览、回看和快速定位长对话内容的 DSH Web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:238"]}
{"unit_id":"kezboardpj__dsh-chat-nav#card-2","repo":"kezboardpj/dsh-chat-nav","commit":"39e34f78abbe336c8c50f6f768763cad3a9fe546","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-nav adds a question rail to DSH Web chats. Bars mark user questions and highlight the current position. Hover for a question and reply preview, or click to jump to a message. It loads older history as needed and lets users adjust bar length and spacing.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:238","lib/client.js:382","lib/client.js:657"]}
